<title>ISRAEL: Hebron negotiators suddenly evacuated from hotel.</title>
<headline>Hebron negotiators suddenly evacuated from hotel.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli, Palestinian and U.S. negotiators were evacuated from a Jerusalem hotel under heavy security in the midst of talks on a Hebron accord, witnesses said.</p>
<p>One participant said the sudden evacuation was ordered for &quot;security reasons.&quot; No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
